  add('iona_world_left_running','The World He Left Running','Earlier / Low Quarter Depot Heist','fighter','iona',['iona_pressure'],[
    room('rehearsal','Ghost Bends rehearsal room','studio','STOLEN SOUNDCHECK COUNT / FIVE NAMES'),room('observatory','Old observatory','quarter','EARLY FLIGHT / RECALL CONTROLS'),room('gantry','Freight gantry','dock','DOWNED ESCORT / PILOT CALL'),room('switch','Depot freight control','service','SHARED CORRIDOR / ANNEX SUPPORT'),room('lift','Residential annex lift','quarter','DARKNESS / ONE PERSON STILL INSIDE'),room('depot','Low Quarter depot','darkfactory','FIVE NAMES / HOLDING ROW'),room('gallery','Loading gallery','darkfactory','COUNTERWEIGHTS / SECURITY APPROACH'),room('records','Records approach','service','CAMERA BLIND CORNER / LOCAL SHUTTER'),room('stairs','West freight stair','service','FALLEN RAIL / OLDER OFFICER'),room('fire_door','West freight fire door','service','SPRING CLOSER / CLEAR THE HEM'),room('west','West loading gate','dock','MARA’S COUNT / YELLOW LINE')],[
    goal('verify','Verify the transfer against the intake','rehearsal',350,'inspect','The sister shows Iona a false voluntary-transfer record certified with Iona’s stolen rehearsal count. The flight sheet lists two people; the depot intake lists five.'),
    scene('divide_work','Give Mara the west gate, crew and count','rehearsal',1250,[['Iona','Red was arrested. AeroTech stamped his transfer. I need you on the ground.'],['Mara','Why me?'],['Iona','You ran our load-outs. You know the west gate, and the crew will follow you. I can’t clear a room from the tower.'],['Mara','I’ll take the gate. I’ll count everyone past the yellow line.'],['Iona','I wait for your count.']]),
    goal('watch_flight','Watch the early transfer flight leave','observatory',350,'inspect','The transport and its smaller escort rise before the planned count is ready. Mara confirms the transport is lining up to land.'),
    goal('recall','Send the transport recall','observatory',1250,'hold','The fictional AeroTech recall forces the transport to land; its escort can break formation. The smaller escort clips the freight gantry. Do not claim the pilot is dead.',{seconds:3,sets:['iona_flight_recalled']}),
    goal('send_medics','Send help to the downed escort','gantry',600,'choice','The pilot calls for help. Iona could keep her crew on the depot route; she sends medics instead. The spotter leaves the west line, and the vans reach the depot before Mara can isolate the freight line.',{answer:'send',options:[['abandon','Keep the crew on the depot','Iona hears the pilot and sends the medics. The west spotter leaves with them.'],['send','Send medics to the gantry','Mara confirms the pilot is still talking. The spotter goes with the medics; the west line will need a new count.']],sets:['iona_medic_response']}),
    goal('cut','Cut the shared freight corridor','switch',1250,'hold','The vans will unload before Mara can make the narrow hold. Stop the shared freight branch now. The connected residential annex will lose power; Iona owns that cost and must reach the lift rescue.',{seconds:5,sets:['iona_freight_cut']}),
    goal('lift_rescue','Reach the resident trapped by the outage','lift',450,'escort','A woman is still in the darkened annex lift. Iona gets her out, explains that the outage is hers, and offers her a choice about helping with the west-line count.',{escort:'lift_resident',escortName:'the rescued lift resident'}),
    goal('lift_handoff','Bring the resident to the public west line','west',500,'handoff','The rescued woman reaches the west line safely. She chooses to help Mara count; she is not treated as an automatic objective marker.'),
    goal('free','Open holding row and bring the two named crew members out','depot',500,'escort','Reach the keys and open the holding gates. A cleared fight alone does not free anyone.',{escort:'freed_pair',escortName:'the two freed crew members'}),
    goal('first_count','Get the rescued pair across the public west line','west',1200,'handoff','Mara and the lift resident count both people beyond the yellow line. The freed woman has Iona’s spare shoes; she sees her friend still inside and chooses to return by the exterior stair.'),
    goal('ledger','Meet Mara at the open west gate','west',1100,'inspect','Mara keeps the west exit open as the clerk approaches with the custody ledger. Iona leaves the clerk free to take the public route.'),
    goal('ledger_handoff','Confirm Mara has the ledger beyond the yellow line','west',1450,'inspect','The clerk freely hands the book to Mara because the west exit remains open. Mara confirms the ledger is across the line before Iona pursues the director.',{sets:['iona_ledger_clear']}),
    goal('position','Coordinate the loading-gallery intervention','gallery',650,'hold','The freed pair take the separate exterior stair, move one counterweight sandbag above the security approach, and radio Mara their return route. The west exit stays clear.',{seconds:3,sets:['iona_gallery_ready']}),
    goal('draw_guard','Wait beside the fixed grille while the first officer unlocks its leaf','records',450,'inspect','The closed security grille joins both walls and reaches floor to ceiling; there is no bypass. Iona stays in the left passage, with three officers in the right security bay. The gallery above them connects to the west stair. The first officer unlocks the narrow hinged leaf, leaving the key ring in its cylinder. It opens outward into the security bay; he only begins entry, his torso still security-side.'),
    goal('sandbag','Drop one sandbag straight into the security bay','records',450,'inspect','The freed pair drop one sandbag straight from the gallery. It strikes the outside of the second officer’s upper arm below the shoulder; he recoils into the third officer. The bag settles on the security-bay floor. The first officer has not crossed the grille. This buys seconds, not an end to pursuit.'),
    goal('gate_recovery','Take the keys from the lock, close the same leaf and test its latch','records',650,'hold','Iona grips the free edge with one hand and pulls the key ring from the lock with the other. Planted in her passage, she pushes the same outward-opening leaf into the first officer’s shoulder and upper torso, sending him back into the bay. She retains the keys, closes the leaf with all three officers and the sandbag security-side, locks it and tests the latch before leaving. They try to reopen it as the freed pair descend the west stair.',{seconds:3,sets:['iona_access_gate_locked']}),
    goal('records_shutter','Raise, cross and lower the separate solid records shutter','records',1250,'hold','The separate solid vertical records shutter starts closed. Iona uses its local control to raise it; beyond it are a glass archive door and the director. She crosses and lowers the shutter to the floor behind herself and a different far-end officer, the fourth officer already on the archive side. The original three remain distant behind the locked grille. These are separate barriers.',{seconds:3,requires:['iona_access_gate_locked'],sets:['iona_records_shutter_closed']}),
    goal('far_end_officer','Pass the fourth officer and catch the glass archive door','records',850,'inspect','The distinct fourth officer blocks the archive entrance. Iona strikes him; he stumbles into the wall, conscious and reaching for his radio. The director closes the separate glass door. Iona catches its edge, cracks a corner against the frame, enters and shuts it. The records shutter stays behind her.'),
    goal('director','Get the North Intake continuation lead from the director','records',1300,'choice','Inside the archive, Iona catches the director in a chokehold and demands who gives the orders. He identifies the North Intake continuation desk, not the unknown original authorizer. She releases the hold and sends him west with her; the local archive HOLD must happen on that route before he departs.',{answer:'ask',options:[['guess','Threaten a name','The director does not know the original authorizer. Ask for the signed continuation desk he can actually identify.'],['ask','Ask where the signed orders are kept','He names North Intake’s continuation desk. Iona releases the chokehold; they set the local archive HOLD on the westward route before he departs. This is a lead, not the authorizer’s identity.']],sets:['iona_north_intake_lead']}),
    goal('hold_archive','Set the local archive HOLD before the director departs','records',750,'hold','On the westward route, the director uses his badge at the local archive door. Iona retains the release key and sets this depot’s archive transfer HOLD before he leaves. Red’s recording plays in the present; Red is not physically here. This local hold proves nothing about remote copies or the wider ORPHEUS system.',{seconds:4,requires:['iona_north_intake_lead'],sets:['iona_archive_held']}),
    goal('director_exit','Send the director toward the west doors','records',1450,'escort','Iona releases him and directs him to the public west exit. His movement does not count as a verified evacuation; Mara must confirm him at the final count.',{requires:['iona_archive_held'],escort:'research_director',escortName:'the released research director'}),
    goal('director_handoff','Keep the west exit clear as the director leaves','west',1300,'handoff','The director reaches the public exit and continues toward the count line. Mara still has to verify him with the rest of the building.'),
    goal('new_patrol','Control the new patrol officer at the west gate','west',850,'inspect','A distinct newly arriving patrol officer grabs Iona at the west gate. She turns him; his flashlight falls along the loading floor, not the stairs. The yard officers hold fire without a safe shot. He is not one of the original three, the fourth archive officer or the older injured officer. There is no burn or all-clear yet.'),
    goal('release_patrol','Release the newly arriving officer toward his colleagues','west',850,'inspect','Iona releases the patrol officer toward his colleagues after using his safety and the archive hold to force a pause. His crossing is not presumed or counted off-panel.'),
    goal('older_officer_rescue','Brace the rail and free the conscious older officer','stairs',850,'escort','On the west freight stair, Iona braces the rail trapping the conscious slate-gray older officer’s leg. He frees it but keeps his injured gait. The separate spring fire door is behind Iona. She supports him toward it; the new patrol officer’s flashlight remains on the loading floor.',{escort:'last_officer',escortName:'the injured older officer'}),
    goal('fire_door','Get both people clear of the spring fire door','fire_door',850,'inspect','The older officer goes through first, catches his injured foot and kneels on the loading floor. Iona’s hem traps in the spring door. From that same loading side he catches her forearm while she cuts the hem with her established work tool through the visible gap. They fall clear before the door shuts; her jacket stays torn. Iona supports his injured gait across the loading floor toward the west yellow line. The freed pair descend the west stair separately.',{requiresEscort:'last_officer'}),
    goal('last_officer','Wait for the older officer to cross the yellow line','west',1450,'handoff','Mara counts the two freed crew members back across the yellow line. The older officer approaches separately with Iona; the lift resident watches his final step and calls only when he is across.',{requiresEscort:'last_officer',sets:['iona_older_counted']}),
    goal('all_clear','Receive Mara’s independent count','west',1350,'inspect','With the ledger safe and the last crossing witnessed, Mara checks the count with the lift resident: Everyone’s out. Officers too. Iona waits for this all-clear before calling the local burn seal.',{requires:['iona_ledger_clear','iona_older_counted'],sets:['iona_all_clear']}),
    goal('burn','Burn only the independently cleared local depot','west',1450,'finish','Only after Mara’s verified all-clear, the local installation, stolen voice archive and Red’s remaining recording burn. The quiet cost is irreversible here: Iona leaves injured, jacket torn, with the recovered ledger. North Intake is still only a lead; the original authorizer remains unknown.',{requires:['iona_ledger_clear','iona_older_counted','iona_all_clear']})],{native:['campaign_complete'],danger:2,routes:[route('rehearsal','observatory','Old freight route'),route('observatory','gantry','Runway service lane'),route('gantry','switch','Depot approach'),route('switch','lift','Residential annex spur'),route('switch','depot','Freight holding route'),route('depot','gallery','Exterior loading stair'),route('gallery','records','Security-side catwalk',{requires:'iona_gallery_ready',closesAfter:'gate_recovery'}),route('records','west','Open public west exit'),route('gallery','west','Separate exterior stair'),route('west','stairs','Return to the west freight stair'),route('stairs','fire_door','Inner fire door'),route('fire_door','west','Freight lane to the public count'),route('west','depot','Public return route')],bridge:'Historical playable interlude: after Red’s arrest and before Iona contacts K through the Volume V voice window. Follow the comic route: recognize the stolen count, assign Mara to the west evacuation, recall the transport, send medics to the downed escort, cut the freight corridor, rescue the lift resident, free the crew, recover the ledger, lock all three pursuers behind the access gate, close the separate records shutter, pass the distinct far-end officer, release the newly arriving patrol officer, rescue and count the older injured officer, then burn only after Mara’s all-clear. The two people Iona freed choose to return and delay the pursuers with a sandbag; the grille and single-person gate explain why the officers cannot all reach her at once. The intervention buys seconds and does not stop the pursuit. The comic’s later Low Quarter and dock chapters remain unchanged.'});
